{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026W1rZD9ZpBx1787558222.jpeg\"/><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">網上近日流傳一段影片，顯示中環有一輛的士卡在兩幅牆壁中間，場面相當尷尬。片段所見，現場為中環卑利街與列拿士地臺交界，該名的士司機疑在小巷嘗試調頭，惟車身最終整輛卡在兩牆之間，車頭及車尾均已明顯刮花。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-24-14h45m10s995.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026tLH9jeRctE1787554280.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-24-14h45m10s995.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">現場畫面顯示，司機已想盡辦法頻頻扭軚嘗試脫困，但由於車頭與車尾的剩餘空間極為狹窄，車輛完全陷入進退兩難的局面。期間更有人上前協助清理地面上的車身碎片。片中有一把女聲傳出：「其實司機好緊張，喺度整咁多差唔多 20 分鐘啦。」她隨後更向現場人士尋求協助：「有冇揸車高手呀？有冇諗到點樣幫到司機？」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-24-14h45m06s204.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026IoRfoKipoj1787554273.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-24-14h45m06s204.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">影片曝光後隨即引發網絡熱議，不少網民對事發原因感到難以理解，紛紛留言笑指：「神手奇技」、「高手先入到去」、「拍緊戲？」。更有網民聯想到電影中的極限駕駛橋段，認為要靠特技才能脫險，笑言：「8000 轉 2 咪車」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-24T07:59:38.885277+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":353,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}